# Contributing to phine.af-common

This repository is a core component of the **phine.af** ecosystem.

Please refer to the main repository's **[Contributor Guide](https://github.com/phinetech/phine.af/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)** for detailed instructions on:

* Developer Certificate of Origin (DCO) commit sign-offs (`git commit -s`).
* Opening Pull Requests as Drafts.
* Running code formatters and test suites locally.

By contributing to this repository, you agree that your contributions will be licensed under the [Apache License 2.0](LICENSE).
